extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3nQituYCXcQQ7kNvwEP-We7&_nc_oc=AdqCcsZzbCK7EIf_5HdLO-Saaacd0t3m2pdWj2of6yGgt-sp1To5rB6OEgTpNvmQ3PI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLFSOiQ87noxHulELq9qcgtQse0ztLvmZ3WNbsN3yxRpQ&oe=6A983ED6"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w2fONzPW0GgQ7kNvwEFXQTr&_nc_oc=Adqk92egn6cvA-CfKlCPuY20yOHjho2azmzZ-g6XglNdY70dWUr95PtLozTyxh83Gs4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJk0mN44Fcg_RP08N-1-2Hz6GPzNkv_en523xJYTHhr9g&oe=6A984622"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PpyJR8Ll4YMQ7kNvwHuySDA&_nc_oc=Adp0DFzamjoxh1NPQoQm6kIyXwOsX_B1J9J7VFuZRvoURytHVh7Xzn6rKuXqhWEMJ2k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLoUOjUGCtfZMB4z_ZM6t3EZinHgng1Qz27YhJbyi0-7A&oe=6A984E19"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":